==Russian==
{{swp|ru:}}

===Etymology===
{{etymon|ru|:af|вода́<id:water>|-ка<id:nominal>}}
From {{af|ru|вода́<t:water>|-ка<pos:diminutive suffix>}}. {{etydate|1533}}, at first only in medical context; the beverage sense appeared in the 17th century and became widespread in the 19th, displacing {{m|ru|хле́бное вино́|lit=grain wine}} by the early 20th century. The beverage sense is probably a {{semantic loan|ru|pl|wódka|nocap=1}}, which, per Brückner, in turn may be a {{semantic loan|ru|la-med|aqua vitae|nocap=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|во́дка}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-водка.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-водка.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|во́дка|*|adj=во́дочный|dim=во́донька,во́дочка|aug=водя́ра}}

# {{lb|ru|usually|uncountable}} [[vodka]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[палёный|палёная]] '''во́дка'''|unlicensed vodka}}
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=1866|author=w:ru:Фёдор Достоевский<t:{{w|Fyodor Dostoevsky}}>|title=w:ru:Преступление и наказание|chapter=s:ru:[[Преступление и наказание (Достоевский)/Часть I/Глава V|Часть I, Глава V]]|location=|publisher=|newversion=English translation from|translator2=w:Constance Garnett|title2=s:[[Crime and Punishment/Part I/Chapter V|Crime and Punishment]]|location2=|publisher2=|year2=1914|page2=|pageurl2=|text=Он о́чень давно́ не пил '''во́дки''', и она́ ми́гом поде́йствовала, хотя́ вы́пита была́ всего́ одна́ рю́мка.|t=It was a long while since he had taken '''vodka''' and it had an effect upon him at once, though he only drank a wineglassful.}}
# {{lb|ru|dated}} [[flavored]] [[liquor]], [[liqueur]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[анисовый|ани́совая]] '''во́дка'''|[[anisette]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[можжевеловый|можжеве́ловая]] '''во́дка'''|[[gin]] (liquor)}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[яблочный|я́блочная]] '''во́дка'''|[[applejack]]}}
# {{lb|ru|pharmacology|obsolete}} [[tincture]] {{gl|a solution of some substance in alcohol for use in medicine or cosmetics}}
# {{lb|ru|chemistry|archaic}} [[aqua]], [[acid]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[царский|ца́рская]] '''во́дка'''|[[aqua regia]]}}

